  "remarks": "LLC ETS ELECTRONICS is a Russian supplier of electronic components and printed circuit boards. The Moscow-based LLC ETS ELECTRONICS imports components, including printed circuit boards, from foreign manufacturers through Chinese company ETC ELECTRONICS Limited. The company supplies those components for many industries, including for the military and industrial complex. LLC ETS ELECTRONICS therefore materially supports Russia’s military and industrial complex.",
